  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A forest plot of percentage agreement between TBST and IGRA in studies including people with active TB, grouped by test pair: C-Tb 5mm vs QFT 79.59%, DST AI vs QFT 97.28%, DST 5mm vs QFT 97.01% and C-TST 5mm vs T-SPOT 85.42%. The overall random-effects pooled agreement is 85.71% (79.53–90.26) across 870 participants, with significant subgroup differences (p < 0.01).",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "مخطط شجري لنسبة التوافق بين اختبارات TBST وIGRA في الدراسات التي شملت مصابين بالسل النشط، مصنّفة حسب زوج الاختبارات: C-Tb 5 مم مقابل QFT 79.59%، وDST AI مقابل QFT 97.28%، وDST 5 مم مقابل QFT 97.01%، وC-TST 5 مم مقابل T-SPOT 85.42%. ويبلغ التوافق المجمّع الإجمالي 85.71% (79.53–90.26) لدى 870 مشاركاً، مع فروق دالّة بين المجموعات الفرعية (p < 0.01).",
      "lang": "ar",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
